<title>USA: Lopez Island, Wash., repriced, top yield unchanged.</title>
<headline>Lopez Island, Wash., repriced, top yield unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it repriced $2.850 million of Lopez Island School District No. 144, Wash., with the top yield unchanged at 5.25 percent in 2012.</p>
</text>
